WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.214
Henry took Rabbit into the kitchen.

2
00:00:10.215 --> 00:00:14.679
"Mom! Can you fix my rabbit?"

3
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:19.994
"Hmm," Mom said. "That's a tricky repair."

4
00:00:19.995 --> 00:00:23.669
Henry frowned. "Vicky did it."

5
00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:37.701
Mom sighed. "I'll see what I can do."

6
00:00:37.702 --> 00:00:41.788
"What if Mom can't fix me?" Rabbit thought.

7
00:00:41.789 --> 00:00:47.068
"She'll take me away like Car!"

8
00:00:47.069 --> 00:00:53.474
Mom got some thread and a needle.

9
00:00:53.475 --> 00:00:58.640
"That looks sharp!" Rabbit thought.

10
00:00:58.641 --> 00:01:07.715
"I can't watch!" Henry ran out of the room.

11
00:01:07.716 --> 00:01:09.563
Rabbit held his breath.

12
00:01:09.564 --> 00:01:13.718
"Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!" he thought.

13
00:01:13.719 --> 00:01:16.464
The needle hurt at first.

14
00:01:16.465 --> 00:01:19.643
But Mom was very gentle.

15
00:01:19.644 --> 00:01:24.048
"This isn't so bad," Rabbit thought.

16
00:01:24.049 --> 00:01:26.893
Mom sewed Rabbit's shoulder.

17
00:01:26.894 --> 00:01:31.381
"Henry sure loves you," Mom said softly.

18
00:01:31.382 --> 00:01:38.208
Rabbit felt a warm glow inside.

19
00:01:38.209 --> 00:01:47.719
Later Mom put Rabbit back in the playroom.

20
00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:51.433
"Guess what, Horse!" Rabbit cried.

21
00:01:51.434 --> 00:01:56.603
"Mom said Henry loves me!"

22
00:01:56.604 --> 00:02:00.709
Horse smiled. "That's wonderful."

23
00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:05.188
"Maybe I'll be real soon!" Rabbit said.

24
00:02:05.189 --> 00:02:08.180
"What a joke!" Robot said.

25
00:02:08.181 --> 00:02:10.945
"You'll never be real.

26
00:02:10.946 --> 00:02:14.072
You're just like the rest of us."

27
00:02:14.073 --> 00:02:16.645
Rabbit's whiskers twitched.

28
00:02:16.646 --> 00:02:20.382
Robot made him so angry sometimes!

29
00:02:20.383 --> 00:02:23.451
But he didn't want to fight.

30
00:02:23.452 --> 00:02:26.336
"Be nice, Robot," Horse said.

31
00:02:26.337 --> 00:02:29.741
"Anything could happen."

32
00:02:29.742 --> 00:02:32.795
"Alert!" Soldier cried suddenly.

33
00:02:32.796 --> 00:02:38.105
"Cousin Vicky is leaving."

34
00:02:38.106 --> 00:02:43.299
"Yay!" All the toys cheered.

35
00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.516
"What a day!" Rabbit thought.

36
00:02:46.517 --> 00:02:54.255
"It was scary—but happy too."

